class: negative
summary: D1341 offers L0684's `else begin` only where the bytes it replaces are the parenthesised name and blanks on one line, so a comment or a line end inside keeps the warning without a fix
program: program.ldn
codes: L0684, L0684, L0684
status: 0
constructs: 1030
targets: linux-x86-64, synthetic-32
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/unused-else-binding-beside-a-comment/program.ldn
expect: expected.txt
